worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_09.js"
  ceiling 1387
  rationale "Part of the mechanically split browser mirror of the Rust solver: issue #658 divided one oversized worker file by line count, so this shard has no subject of its own. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 1285 to 1318 with the entity-grounded hours place lookup and its seed cache. Ceiling moved 1318 to 1387 with issue #1175's NATURAL_LANGUAGE_MARKER_WORDS guard (parsesAsCommandArguments and maskQuotedSpans mirroring src/solver_terminal.rs), so a prompt like 'Find the bug: def average(xs): ...' is a debugging request, not a shell command."
